          429
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "habitat",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Gui Wang descends on that sunflower sea. Countless Ghost Face Gu fly up as he scoops them up with nether ghost claw. He then activates several hundred Ghost Face Gu with hundred ghost night travel Gu, sending spirits, souls, and ghost faces through the air like a mill that crushes the foes in his path.",
